      "type": "custom-liquid",
      "name": "t:sections.custom-liquid.presets.name",
      "settings": {
        "section_fullwidth": false,
        "custom_liquid": "<div class=\"tbk-trust-wrapper\">\n\n  <h2 class=\"tbk-trust-heading\">\n    Why Customers Choose The Baking Kaur\n  </h2>\n\n  <p class=\"tbk-trust-intro\">\n    At <strong>The Baking Kaur</strong>, every cake is more than a dessert — it’s a promise of quality, \n    craftsmanship, and unforgettable taste. Our customers choose us for our attention to detail, \n    premium ingredients, and reliable service across Meerut.\n  </p>\n\n  <ul class=\"tbk-trust-list\">\n    <li><strong>Luxury Custom Designs</strong> – Every cake is uniquely crafted to match your celebration</li>\n    <li><strong>Premium Ingredients</strong> – High-quality chocolates, fresh creams, and rich flavours</li>\n    <li><strong>100% Eggless Cakes</strong> – Safe, delicious, and perfect for all preference",
